## Assets and marks — NOT covered by this licence

The WVRPS assets are served separately by WVRPS Studio through the wvrps.com creator API
(after you pair the editor with a free creator key). They are governed by their own terms:

> You may use these WVRPS assets in your own games and projects, including commercially.
> You may not resell the assets, or transfer any commercial rights in them to anyone else.

The WVRPS name, logo, and characters (Nayomi, Gnar Heart, DJ Dragoon) and related marks are
the property of WVRPS Studio. Nothing in the MIT licence above grants any right to the assets
or the marks. The MIT licence covers the plugin source code only.
